@startuml
title State Diagram - Laboratory Work State

[*] --> NotStarted

NotStarted --> RequirementsRead : open task
RequirementsRead --> Planned : create plan
Planned --> InProgress : start work
InProgress --> WaitingForClarification : question appears
WaitingForClarification --> InProgress : clarification received

InProgress --> Implemented : code or model completed
Implemented --> Documented : documentation written
Documented --> Checked : build/tests/diagrams checked
Checked --> Committed : commit changes
Committed --> Pushed : push to GitHub
Pushed --> Submitted : submit link

Submitted --> UnderReview : teacher opens work
UnderReview --> Accepted : work is correct
UnderReview --> NeedsFixes : comments received
NeedsFixes --> InProgress : fix problems

Accepted --> [*]

@enduml
